<title>NETHERLANDS: DUTCH BONDS END DOWN AS RECOVERY DOES NOT HOLD.</title>
<headline>DUTCH BONDS END DOWN AS RECOVERY DOES NOT HOLD.</headline>
<text>
<p>---------------------(Snapshot at 1535 GMT)---------------------</p>
<p>* DUTCH STATE LOANS	 PRICES			  BID YIELDS</p>
<p>  June 1999 7.50 pct	106.00/10 (-0.14)	   4.01 (+0.06)</p>
<p>  Feb  2002		   113.58/68 (-0.34)	   4.80 (+0.06)</p>
<p>  Feb  2007 5.75 pct	100.72/82 (-0.27)	   5.64 (+0.03)</p>
<p>  Jan  2023		   114.13/33 (-0.55)	   6.36 (+0.03)</p>
<p>* BUND FUTURE (Sept)	101.96 (-0.26)</p>
